{
  "name": "Kualat: Link creation API (webhook → kua.lat)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Link creation API\n\nThis workflow opens a POST endpoint on n8n: send `{\"url\": \"https://example.com\"}` as the body and the endpoint replies with the freshly created short URL.\n\nUseful for wiring up other tools (forms, bots, spreadsheets via Apps Script) without writing any integration code.\n\n**Set up:**\n1. Install the **@kualat/n8n-nodes-kualat** community node under Settings → Community Nodes.\n2. Create a **Kualat API** credential (API URL, for example `https://kua.lat/api`, and an API key).\n3. Activate the workflow, then use the Production URL shown on the Webhook node.\n\nExample call:\n`curl -X POST https://n8n.example.com/webhook/kualat-create-link -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"url\": \"https://example.com/promo\"}'`",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "kualat-create-link",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "link",
        "operation": "create",
        "url": "={{ $json.body.url }}"
      },
      "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Create Link",
      "type": "@kualat/n8n-nodes-kualat.kualat",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [260, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"id\": $json.id, \"short_url\": $json.short_url, \"long_url\": $json.long_url } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Respond",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [520, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Link",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create Link": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {}
}
